    "File > New > Standard (mm).ipt and save it as housing.ipt.",
    "Sketch a rectangle 190 x 88 on the XZ Plane and Extrude it 135 mm up.",
    "Sketch a rectangle 240 x 88 on the bottom face and Extrude it 12 mm (the mounting feet), Join."
   ],
   "note": null,
   "parts": [
    {
     "name": "gearbox housing",
