  {
   "n": 2,
   "title": "Gearbox housing: shell it out",
   "command": "3D Model tab > Modify panel > Shell",
   "actions": [
    "Shell: remove the top face, thickness 10 mm on the end walls. Then Extrude Cut the side walls back so they are 14 thick (they carry the bearings), and the floor 12."
   ],
   "note": "A cast housing is hollow so the gears can run in oil, with walls thick enough to hold the bearings.",
   "parts": [
    {
     "name": "gearbox housing",
